        <mxCell id="n15" value="The recorded evidence for this phase came off the development machine, not off the lane the&#10;plan names as its venue — and on that machine the detection rate measured 2.65 per second&#10;against a floor of 5. The machine emulates a different processor, so the figure understates a&#10;real runner; the number that decides the criterion is the one taken on the deployed node." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="460" width="720" height="93.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
